        "original_id": "959b11bc-0663-58ad-843a-90122826f070",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: One Manhattan Square, Time Warner Center, 247 Cherry\n- Companies: Extell Development Company, The Related Companies, AREA Property Partners, Skidmore Owings & Merrill\n- People: David Childs, Mustafa Kemal Abadan\n- Places: Two Bridges, Manhattan, New York City\n\nFacts:\n- One Manhattan Square, also known as 227 Cherry Street or 250 South Street, is a residential skyscraper project in Two Bridges, Manhattan, New York City.\n- Extell Development Company is developing One Manhattan Square.\n- One Manhattan Square is planned to rise 80 stories or 850 feet (259 m) and may include a new supermarket in its base.\n- 247 Cherry will be adjacent to One Manhattan Square.\n- Time Warner Center was developed by The Related Companies and AREA Property Partners, formerly Apollo Real Estate Advisors.\n- Time Warner Center was designed by David Childs and Mustafa Kemal Abadan of Skidmore, Owings & Merrill.\n- Time Warner Center consists of two 750-foot twin towers connected by a multi-story atrium with upscale retail shops.",
